concept:australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Certain persons cease to be members of the Australian Public"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Service  (1) On the transfer day, an officer of the Australian Public Service to whom this subsection applies ceases, by force of this section, to be an officer of the Australian Public Service.  (2) Subsection (1) applies to the following officers:" ;
