doc:sec-8-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8(2) Transfer of personnel files" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In a case referred to in paragraph (1)(a), the relevant Secretary or Agency Head (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999) may deliver to the appropriate authority of the Australian Capital Territory all records kept by the Secretary or Agency Head in relation to the person and reasonably necessary to be so delivered   Provisions related to the establishment of the Australian Capital Territory Government Service  Part 2  Section 9  Australian Capital Territory Government Service (Consequential Provisions) Act 1994 Compilation date: 18/10/2023 Registered: 14/11/2023  in connection with the employment of the person as an ACT officer." ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

