    skos:prefLabel "8(3) Transfer of personnel files"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In a case referred to in paragraph (1)(b), records kept, in relation to the person, for the purposes of the Australian Capital Territory Government Service may be delivered to the relevant Secretary or Agency Head (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999) if it is reasonably necessary for the records to be so delivered in connection with the employment of the person as an officer of the Australian Public Service." ;
